 "choice_rationale": "No region produced a genuine failure except WWEST, whose cylinder query exceeds G2's 120 s limit on 20/200 uniform confirmed pairs (METHOD-TIMEOUT; 0 UNREACHABLE anywhere). Criterion = genuine + by-tolerance rate (export artefacts excluded), cylinder, uniform pilot: GAPW1 19.5 % (0 + 39), WWEST 15.5 % (20 + 11), S 14.5 % (0 + 29), G2MID 9 % (0 + 18); E and NMID yield no confirmed pair. Split: WWEST 2500 (the only genuine failures; long pairs up to 7.3 m, detour ratio p90 1.49), GAPW1 1500 (highest by-tolerance rate: endpoints over the u~-5.6 floor-splat field; detour p90 1.53), S 1000 (tightest geometry: 42 % of A* routes have lateral clearance <= 2 mm; cheapest). All three together fit F4's 200 CPU-h with > 3x margin. Backup G2MID: one lattice component (pre-filter pass 100 %), 3.5 s/pair sampling.",
 "confirmation_rule": "real cylinder, margin 0.001, 0.1 m lattice A* (LatticePlanner; pos tol 0, yaw tol 0.05, 500k expansions, 120 s wall) ROUTE + verify_path re-check; straight distance >= 3 m; no robust inflation (experiments/aerial3dg_fail3_sample.py docstring)",
